Train (or continue training) a classifier network on a directory dataset

<BIN> train [OPTIONS]

OPTIONS:
  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit
          --network TEXT REQUIRED 
                              Network save path (.wgt). Created if missing.
          --working-directory TEXT [training-data]  
                              Working directory for training data.

Config:
          --learning-config TEXT:FILE 
                              Load training hyperparameters from a JSON file (as written to
                              learning-config.json); flags below override individual fields
                              from the loaded config.
          --network-config TEXT:FILE 
                              Load network topology from a JSON file (as written to
                              network-config.json), used only when creating a new network;
                              flags below override individual fields from the loaded config.

Dataset:
          --dataset TEXT      Dataset root used for both training and testing (subdirs 0..9).
                              Overridden per-side by --train-dataset/--test-dataset.
          --train-dataset TEXT 
                              Training data root (subdirs 0..<num_of_classes-1>); falls back to
                              --dataset if not set.
          --test-dataset TEXT Testing data root (subdirs 0..<num_of_classes-1>); falls back to
                              --dataset if not set.
          --test-file-limit UINT [0]  
                              Max test files per class (0 = all). Runs evaluation after
                              training.
          --dataset-img-width UINT [28]  
                              Width of test images in pixels.
          --dataset-img-height UINT [28]  
                              Height of test images in pixels.

Network:
          --layers UINT [[784,50,20,10]]  ... 
                              Layer sizes, comma-separated (used only when creating a new
                              network)
          --hidden-activation ENUM:value in {relu->1,sigmoid->0,softmax->3,tanh->2} OR {1,0,3,2} [1]  
                              Hidden layer activation (used only when creating a new network)
          --output-activation ENUM:value in {relu->1,sigmoid->0,softmax->3,tanh->2} OR {1,0,3,2} [3]  
                              Output layer activation (used only when creating a new network)

Training:
          --initial-lr FLOAT [0.2]  
                              Initial learning rate
          --min-lr FLOAT [0.0001]  
                              Minimum learning rate
          --lr-decay FLOAT [0.7]  
                              Learning rate decay factor
          --max-epochs UINT [500]  
                              Maximum training epochs
          --patience UINT [10]  
                              Early-stopping patience (epochs)
          --inner-epochs UINT [1]  
                              Backprop passes per sample per epoch
          --dropout FLOAT [0]  
                              Dropout rate
          --dataset-limit-per-label, --dataset-file-limit UINT [100]  
                              Max training files per class (0 = all)
